      <activity id="68d29cc8-547f-5941-8afc-2fe3a501a02f" activityNameId="7d8cf4f4-8cd9-565e-a217-7721df9a9a26" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Passenger car
The values refer to the production of one Golf A4. ;
UUID: 1110950f-5ed3-3daf-a763-8fc41c9814a6
The inventory includes  processes of  material, energy and water use in vehicle manufacturing. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for. Plant infrastructure is included, addressing issues such as land use, building, road and parking construction.
Location: Vehicle material and production data are taken from an LCI analysis. 
Technology: Current production technology, environmental issues have been addressed in the past.
Time period: The material consumption reflect a modern vehicle. The data for vehicle production are representative for a production sites with an environmental management system. Thus, the resulting data may be an underestimation of environmental impacts of an average vehicle fleet.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Production data is taken from an LCI analysis of one passenger car (Golf A4) 
Extrapolations: Data for one passenger car type is used as an first estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1110950f-5ed3-3daf-a763-8fc41c9814a6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
